		{
			"id": "111599228046256657",
			"parentId": "111599139817087063",
			"url": "https://social.dryan.com/@d/111599228032618639",
			"author": {
				"name": "Dan Ryan :dryan:",
				"url": "https://social.dryan.com/@d",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/293/804/817/015/572/original/b93ef5db0503b13f.jpeg"
			},
			"date": "2023-12-18T03:11:20.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> almost nothing is a zero-sum game. The faster we all figure that out the better.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "111599233455589542",
			"parentId": "111599196094258090",
			"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat/111599233455589542",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/accounts/avatars/109/286/461/031/266/152/original/dc489c3746a44e00.png"
			},
			"date": "2023-12-18T03:12:42.836Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@xavdid\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>xavdid</span></a></span> Astro and Eleventy share the same zero JavaScript footprint vision for the web. Astro devs have said that Eleventy inspired their project from the beginning!</p><p>A few key differentiators:<br />1. We didn’t take VC funding: we’re in it for the long haul.<br />2. They are bundler-first and Vite-based, which is great but has build performance costs. Eleventy is faster because we don’t bundle a bundler.</p><p>A few more:<br />* <a href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/web/site-generator-review/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://www.</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">zachleat.com/web/site-generato</span><span class=\"invisible\">r-review/</span></a><br />* <a href=\"https://www.11ty.dev/docs/performance/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://www.</span><span class=\"\">11ty.dev/docs/performance/</span><span class=\"invisible\"></span></a><br />* <a href=\"https://www.11ty.dev/blog/newstack/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://www.</span><span class=\"\">11ty.dev/blog/newstack/</span><span class=\"invisible\"></span></a></p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
