			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Next.js is only ‘at the top’ if you’re on Twitter or believe the marketing. It’s far from the most popular framework</p>",
