			"date": "2023-12-18T14:35:49.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> it's hard to see what argument is the best to convince enterprise away from Next.js :/</p>",
