			"date": "2023-12-18T14:38:09.184Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@scrwd\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>scrwd</span></a></span> enterprises are often the slowest movers in the space, the ever given still obstructing the suez canal 😅</p>",
