			},
			"date": "2023-12-18T16:51:33.351Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mas.to/@nmoo\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>nmoo</span></a></span> Page 10 (of 13) of the primary report had the original chart (alone). The second chart showing absolute numbers for sentiment was buried in the appendices on Page 32 (of 39).</p><p>(And I *really* appreciate you for saying this)</p>",
